@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Serif"
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #1F1F5C
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9A9AB0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #333333
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #333333
skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #BBBBBB
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontColor #1F1F5C
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam noteBorderColor #888888
skinparam noteFontName "Liberation Mono"
skinparam noteFontColor #6A6A99
skinparam noteFontSize 12
skinparam ParticipantPadding 18
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam maxMessageSize 400


actor "Source\nSystem" as SRC
participant "Change Data\nCapture (CDC)" as CDC
box "Streaming Platform (Kafka)" #FFFFFF
  participant "Raw Topic\n(cdc.events.raw)" as RAW
  participant "Enriched Topic\n(cdc.events.enriched)" as ENR
end box
participant "Enrichment\nAgent" as AGT
participant "Business\nConsumers" as BIZ

note over CDC, BIZ
[ ARCHITECTURE NOTE ]
Asynchronous Event-Driven Processing (Kappa Architecture Pattern).
The agent manages its own backpressure through the native Kafka Consumer Poll loop.
end note

SRC -> CDC : 1. Data Operation (INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE)
activate CDC
CDC -> RAW : 2. Stream Mutation Record\n{headers: [trace_id], payload: raw_record}
deactivate CDC

group Async Consumption Loop [Poll Loop Active]
  AGT -> RAW : 3. poll(long_timeout) / Request Event Batch
  activate AGT
  RAW --> AGT : 4. Return Consumer Records (ConsumerRecords)
  note right of AGT
  **Agent Relevance Evaluation**
  Initial deterministic filter (Business Rules/Schema).
  Avoids invoking the LLM unnecessarily to optimize FinOps.
  end note
  AGT -> AGT : 5. Validate event relevance and lineage
  alt Event Requires Semantic Enrichment
    AGT -> AGT : 6. LLM Inference (RAG / Semantic Context)
    AGT -> ENR : 7. Publish Processed Event\n{id, metadata: [ai_model, tokens], enriched_payload}
  else Event Is Irrelevant or Ignorable
    AGT -> AGT : 8. Commit Offset without mutation
  end
  AGT -> RAW : 9. Confirm Offset (Acknowledge / Commit Offsets)
  deactivate AGT
end

ENR -> BIZ : 10. Event Distribution (Pub/Sub Event Delivery)
activate BIZ
BIZ -> BIZ : 11. Process at own pace (Decoupled Architecture)
deactivate BIZ

note over RAW, ENR
[ BACKPRESSURE POLICY ]
If the agent slows down (e.g., LLM API latency), events accumulate
safely in Kafka partitions. Business consumers suffer no memory degradation.
end note
note over BIZ
[ DOWNSTREAM CONSUMER CHANNELS ]
The immutable enriched event feeds multiple workloads:
- Advanced Analytics (Data Lakehouse / Silver-Gold Layer)
- Executable Automation (Action Microservices)
- Monitoring and Alerts (Business Observability)
end note
@enduml
